{#
  PARICHEHR AS A PRODUCT DESIGNER — redesign 1669:6512 (the title) and the
  twelve photos around it (1669:6527 … 1669:6571), from home.about.photos.

  The section is the comp's 1082 x 1320 block (2269 to 3589 at 1512), in
  proportion. The photos lie where the comp puts them; as the page scrolls
  each rises faster than the page, at its own pace, the title too but
  slower, so by the time the section's top reaches the top of the screen the
  first photos already reach up into the projects
  (scripts/v4-photo-drift.js sets --drift). Hover (tap on a phone, or focus)
  turns a photo over to its back: photo.back, written later, or the caption.

  `spots` are the comp's corners in px from the column's top-left, in the
  order of its frames; `speed` how far each drifts, in screens: no two alike, so they move
  like separate things; all faster than the title (0.12).
#}
{%- set spots = [
  { x: 47,  y: 926,  speed: 0.34, photo: 2 },
  { x: 317, y: 765,  speed: 0.25, photo: 3 },
  { x: 0,   y: 60,   speed: 0.30, photo: 4 },
  { x: 787, y: 94,   speed: 0.21, photo: 5 },
  { x: 655, y: 732,  speed: 0.28, photo: 6 },
  { x: 449, y: 1036, speed: 0.38, photo: 7 },
  { x: 424, y: 141,  speed: 0.23, photo: 8 },
  { x: 924, y: 696,  speed: 0.32, photo: 9 },
  { x: 819, y: 1007, speed: 0.36, photo: 10 },
  { x: 4,   y: 601,  speed: 0.19, photo: 11 },
  { x: 130, y: 296,  speed: 0.27, photo: 0 },
  { x: 889, y: 392,  speed: 0.24, photo: 1 }
] %}
<section class="v5-photos" id="about" aria-labelledby="photos-title" data-drift>
  <h2 class="v5-photos__title" id="photos-title" style="--speed: 0.12">Parichehr<br>as a<br>product designer</h2>
  <ul class="v5-photos__list">
    {%- for s in spots %}
    {%- set photo = home.about.photos[s.photo] %}
    <li class="v5-photo" style="--x: {{ s.x }}; --y: {{ s.y }}; --speed: {{ s.speed }}">
      <button class="v5-photo__card" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{ photo.caption }}: turn over">
        <span class="v5-photo__inner">
          <span class="v5-photo__front">
            <img src="{{ photo.src }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}" width="224" height="270" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false" />
          </span>
          <span class="v5-photo__back">{{ photo.back or photo.caption }}</span>
        </span>
      </button>
      <p class="v5-photo__caption">{{ photo.caption }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
